{"parentUuid":"4c15b50c-de59-4752-91f8-f07d727e06ff","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"Concise","turnReminder":"Be concise: lead with the result, skip preamble and narration, keep only what the user needs."},"type":"attachment","uuid":"8d8fee47-462b-47e6-97da-25010291fb85","timestamp":"2026-10-21T04:42:22.892Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nConcise output style is active. Be concise: lead with the result, skip preamble and narration, keep only what the user needs.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/t06-colon","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.292","gitBranch":"fix/reject-colon-references","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
{"parentUuid":"8d8fee47-462b-47e6-97da-25010291fb85","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEmbPEvdJf4GKhyggH26","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR #270 is open and ready for review (not a draft), on `main`. It rejects the colon form of package references (`cargo:foo`) with E316 and names the slash form (`cargo/foo`). The commit is signed and shows verified on GitHub. Local `just ci` passed with 92.78% coverage, and hosted CI is still running.\n\n- **Where it applies:**\n  - `--package` on `add`, `matrix` and `release`.\n  - Changeset entries and `pre.json` keys.\n  - Group members and `[[package]]` / `[[package-set]]` `match`.\n  - `product-package` and `[[release.artifact]] package`.\n- **Latent bug fixed:** a group member that failed to resolve used to turn every error into \"member not found\". That would have hidden E316, and it was also hiding E103 (ambiguous name). Both now reach the user.\n- **Dependency warning:** the ambiguous-dependency warning now lists candidates as `cargo/foo`. It was the one place that printed the colon form.\n- **Remaining T06 slices:** canonical-required config (E317), canonical command-line arguments and canonical emission.\n- **#267:** it is merged, so all 16 earlier PRs are in.\n\n**Open decision:** the E317 slice makes a bare package name in `callisto.toml` an error, which breaks configs that use bare group members (this repo's own `callisto.toml` does). Should I go ahead, or leave bare names allowed in config?\n\nresult: PR #270 (not draft, signed, local CI green) rejects the colon form of package references with E316 across CLI, config, changesets and pre.json; the next T06 slice, E317 (bare names in config), needs your call because it would break existing configs."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":311,"cache_read_input_tokens":211480,"output_tokens":564,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":311,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":564,"cache_read_input_tokens":211480,"cache_creation_input_tokens":311,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":311},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1b53289d-7b72-4210-bc52-8a280fee9130","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEmbNvLD5fTKBnTt8EDe","type":"assistant","uuid":"774a4d77-8f0e-4a44-a6c3-cce678b9f942","timestamp":"2026-10-21T04:42:27.578Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/t06-colon","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.292","gitBranch":"fix/reject-colon-references","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
