{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01RnkWesCzJyeY97T2UxQPcQ","lastSequenceNum":4761,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"a662360d-915a-4bf5-a5b9-2150b8633c80","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFr4Q1nrqA4rnCHDwBnn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"michi doesn't version its crates in lockstep, so matching michi means independent versions, which is what I recommended. I checked its `Cargo.toml` and `AGENTS.md`:\n- `michi` is at 0.2.0, `michi-toon` at 0.2.0, and `michi-core`, `michi-truncate` and `michi-resilience` at 0.1.0.\n- `AGENTS.md` says `michi-pipeline` is \"versioned independently\".\n- Its `callisto.toml` lists each crate as its own `[[package]]` with no `[[fixed-group]]`.\n\nCallisto is the one with a fixed group today: all five crates move together.\n\nIndependent versions suit michi because its crates are real libraries that people depend on separately. Callisto's libraries are the internals of one CLI, so lockstep is also a legitimate choice there.\n\n| Option | What it means for callisto | Cost |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Independent, michi-style (my recommendation) | `callisto-cli` goes to 1.0 and the libraries stay 0.x, documented as unstable. The fixed group is removed and each crate gets its own `[[package]]` entry | A library break doesn't force a CLI major. We run semver-checks only on crates we promise stability for |\n| Lockstep | All five crates go to 1.0 together | Every release bumps every crate, and the 1.0 label on the libraries needs an \"internal, no API guarantee\" note |\n\nI'm going with independent versions unless you say otherwise.\n\nRecorded: all other recommendations are accepted, including the dist-tag rule, the `schemaVersion` 2 bump with its three companions, and E317. OIDC trusted publishing is a post-1.0 feature to build, and I added it to the plan notes.\n\nI'll start with the CI hygiene PR (MSRV job, scheduled `cargo deny`, Cargo dependabot, semver-checks), then T06 PR 3 (E317). Tell me if you want a different order.\n\nresult: Your answers are recorded in the local plan notes; michi versions its crates independently, so the plan stays CLI at 1.0 and libraries at 0.x unless you choose lockstep, and I start the CI hygiene PR next."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1775,"cache_read_input_tokens":110341,"output_tokens":731,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1775,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":731,"cache_read_input_tokens":110341,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1775,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1775},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ff9667bd-d3e5-4cdb-a2bc-4978a624962c","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFr4PexgQ8jwVN6HjqPq","requestRef":"97c43e47-7ad1-424c-be4d-09eb01ead988","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"6bb8f866-5186-485e-8837-9638e6d020ba","timestamp":"2026-10-21T18:21:38.089Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/plans","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"stack/docs-v1","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
