{"parentUuid":"9961862d-0c15-4bba-8c98-4559d2d3a509","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFrRWv6jFj8iPi2jPggq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012J2CFc7Qtmkob867uJtNwH","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"gh pr create --base main --head ci/msrv-advisories-dependabot --title \"ci: test the declared Rust version, scan advisories weekly and update crates\" --body \"A new CI job checks the workspace on the \\`rust-version\\` declared in \\`Cargo.toml\\` (1.96), read from the manifest so it cannot drift.\n\n- Weekly \\`cargo deny check advisories\\` workflow, also runnable on demand. A new advisory now surfaces without waiting for a pull request.\n- Dependabot covers Cargo dependencies, grouped weekly with a 7-day cooldown like the actions.\n- \\`deny.toml\\` no longer allows \\`AGPL-3.0-only\\` and rejects wildcard version requirements (path dependencies stay allowed).\n\nVerified locally: \\`cargo +1.96 check --workspace --all-targets --locked\\` passes, \\`cargo deny check\\` passes with the tighter config, and \\`just zizmor\\`, \\`just workflow-contracts\\` and the action-pin check pass.\n\n\\`cargo-semver-checks\\` is not part of this change: the libraries become internal at 1.0, so it will cover only the surfaces we promise.\" 2>&1 | tail -2","description":"Open the PR ready for review"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":767,"cache_read_input_tokens":137644,"output_tokens":476,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":767,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":476,"cache_read_input_tokens":137644,"cache_creation_input_tokens":767,"cache_creation":{"