{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01RnkWesCzJyeY97T2UxQPcQ","lastSequenceNum":4761,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"6118e6e7-a5f3-40ad-8479-fff393e79d5a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFrSW1p7NJ78vvcsbsRZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR #271 (MSRV job, weekly advisories, Cargo dependabot) is open and ready for review. Its hosted CI is still running.\n\n- **MSRV job:** it reads `rust-version` from `Cargo.toml` and runs `cargo check --workspace --all-targets --locked`. The workspace passes on Rust 1.96 locally.\n- **Weekly advisories:** a new workflow runs `cargo deny check advisories` every Monday and can also be started by hand.\n- **Dependabot:** it now covers Cargo dependencies, grouped weekly with a 7-day cooldown.\n- **`deny.toml`:** I removed the `AGPL-3.0-only` allowance and now reject wildcard version requirements. Path dependencies stay allowed. `cargo deny check` still passes.\n- **Linters:** `just zizmor`, `just workflow-contracts` and the action-pin check all pass locally. The commit is signed.\n- **Left out:** `cargo-semver-checks`. The libraries become internal at 1.0, so it will cover only the surfaces we promise.\n\nNext is T06 PR 3: bare package names in `callisto.toml` become error E317 with the `eco/name` fix-it. I'll also convert this repo's `callisto.toml` and delete the dead `resolve_human`. I'll start it in a new worktree off `main` and report when its PR is open.\n\nresult: PR #271 (MSRV job, weekly advisory scan, Cargo dependabot, tighter `deny.toml`) is open, signed and not a draft, with local checks green and hosted CI still running; I'm starting T06 PR 3 (E317) next."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":875,"cache_read_input_tokens":139483,"output_tokens":550,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":875,"epheme