{"parentUuid":"60563b7d-e3f5-48ab-9abf-36dfc32dbe27","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFvyGSKjbdUjsuw7CDiv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QBQiuU9voAb3YY4PYPRX6y","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/pre-mode-noop/.changeset/pre-mode-no-repeat-bump.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\nIn pre-release mode, `version` no longer bumps a package again when its only changesets are already recorded in `pre.json`: a rerun with nothing new changes nothing, and `status` stops reporting it as pending. A new changeset produces the next prerelease. `release-pr decide` now refuses pre-release mode with E318 and a local-release fix, instead of opening a pull request that cannot release.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1474,"cache_read_input_tokens":345370,"output_tokens":1169,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1474,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1169,"cache_read_input_tokens":345370,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1474,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1474},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01QBQiuU9voAb3YY4PYPRX6y":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/pre-mode-noop/.changeset/pre-mode-no-repeat-bump.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\nIn pre-release mode, `version` no longer bumps a package again when its only changesets are already recorded in `pre.json`: a rerun with nothing n