{"parentUuid":"ba873048-4b64-4258-9719-e7303fdcf563","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"task_reminder","content":[{"id":"1","subject":"Pre mode no-op fix and managed-route error (A3)","description":"version in pre mode with no changeset must not bump again; managed route fails early with one clear error; document pre mode as local-only.","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"2","subject":"Range hard stop before any write; graduate pre ranges (A4)","description":"Unrepresentable peer or compound ranges are a hard error before any write; rewrite dependents' ^X-pre ranges when the dependency graduates.","status":"in_progress","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"3","subject":"Dist-tag from pre identifier; refuse snapshot release (decisions 4, 5)","description":"npm dist-tag derives from the first alphabetic pre identifier, fallback next, never latest. release refuses a snapshot version.","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"5","subject":"T06 PR 4: delete dead bare machinery, rules through identity index","description":"Remove resolve_package_config second pass, promoted_siblings on config, bare-rule diagnostic emission, from_groups, resolve_unique, resolve_human. Branch from main after #272 merges.","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"6","subject":"T06 PR 5: canonical emission and schemaVersion 2","description":"Canonical ids in status, version, snapshot and matrix report keys; schemaVersion 2 on the four reports; text tables canonical.","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"7","subject":"Redacted tail on E176 and E157; status --check flags pending-without-changeset","description":"Print-only redacted tail (20 lines or 2 KiB), no wire change. status --check flags pending-without-changeset for auto packages in managed CI. Python dev table skip becomes a warning naming the file.","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]}],"itemCount":6},"type":"attachment","uuid":"0c30ced9-f022-42be-a0fc-e0e7c