{"parentUuid":"5bbd3cda-3875-4772-b067-c9a42e1045e2","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"task_reminder","content":[{"id":"1","subject":"Pre mode no-op fix and managed-route error (A3)","description":"version in pre mode with no changeset must not bump again; managed route fails early with one clear error; document pre mode as local-only.","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"2","subject":"Range hard stop before any write; graduate pre ranges (A4)","description":"Unrepresentable peer or compound ranges are a hard error before any write; rewrite dependents' ^X-pre ranges when the dependency graduates.","status":"in_progress","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"3","subject":"Dist-tag from pre identifier; refuse snapshot release (decisions 4, 5)","description":"npm dist-tag derives from the first alphabetic pre identifier, fallback next, never latest. release refuses a snapshot version.","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"5","subject":"T06 PR 4: delete dead bare machinery, rules through identity index","description":"Remove resolve_package_config second pass, promoted_siblings on config, bare-rule diagnostic emission, from_groups, resolve_unique, resolve_human. Branch from main after #272 merges.","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"6","subject":"T06 PR 5: canonical emission and schemaVersion 2","description":"Canonical ids in status, version, snapshot and matrix report keys; schemaVersion 2 on the four reports; text tables canonical.","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"7","subject":"Redacted tail on E176 and E157; status --check flags pending-without-changeset","description":"Print-only redacted tail (20 lines or 2 KiB), no wire change. status --check flags pending-without-changeset for auto packages in managed CI. Python dev table skip becomes a warning naming the file.","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]}],"itemCount":6},"type":"attachment","uuid":"2b934a4c-81be-42b8-ba66-2b0eb0650618","timestamp":"2026-10-21T19:40:23.640Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nThe task tools haven't been used recently. If you're working on tasks that would benefit from tracking progress, consider using TaskCreate to add new tasks and TaskUpdate to update task status (set to in_progress when starting, completed when done). Also consider cleaning up the task list if it has become stale. Only use these if relevant to the current work. This is just a gentle reminder - ignore if not applicable.\n\n\nHere are the existing tasks:\n\n#1. [completed] Pre mode no-op fix and managed-route error (A3)\n#2. [in_progress] Range hard stop before any write; graduate pre ranges (A4)\n#3. [pending] Dist-tag from pre identifier; refuse snapshot release (decisions 4, 5)\n#5. [pending] T06 PR 4: delete dead bare machinery, rules through identity index\n#6. [pending] T06 PR 5: canonical emission and schemaVersion 2\n#7. [pending] Redacted tail on E176 and E157; status --check flags pending-without-changeset\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/range-hard-stop","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"worktree-range-hard-stop","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
