{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","hash":"1cc0cbd949328f536a21be0ed464541b1a0fe9c100794ea0833c292ff3a32b20","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fixing a quote artifact from my script, then the remaining doc and plan references."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015ZwdFp1hvejpTKHKStDFyy","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/t06-dead-bare/crates/callisto-graph/src/aggregate/tests.rs","old_string":"/// package'\"'\"'s own ecosystem","new_string":"/// package's own ecosystem"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JjPDpfZcpKr2LfkrmTfaqU","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'PYEOF'\ndef rep(path, old, new):\n    s=open(path).read()\n    assert old in s,(path,old[:60])\n    open(path,'w').write(s.replace(old,new,1))\nrep('docs/architecture/identity.md',' Config rejects a rule without its ecosystem (E317), so the bare-rule second pass is unreachable from a loaded config.',' Config rejects a rule without its ecosystem (E317), so every rule is ecosystem-qualified.')\nrep('docs/architecture/identity.md','3. `GroupTable::resolve` binds group members to ids, then names promoted into several ecosystems are recorded as `promoted_siblings`.\\n4. The tag index','3. `GroupTable::resolve` binds group members to ids.\\n4. The tag index')\nrep('docs/projects/V1-SYSTEM-HARDENING.json',\"Baseline: IdentityIndex.resolve_id resolves native names; the status helpers no longer use PackageId::resolve_unique, which is unused outside its tests. GroupTable::from_groups is deprecated and has no caller. Rules and packages match only the primary name\",\"Baseline: IdentityIndex.resolve_id resolves native names. Rules and packages match only the primary name\")\nrep('docs/projects/V1-SYSTEM-HARDENING.json',\" Share group membership validation between GroupTable::resolve and try_from_groups, and delete the dead from_groups, resolve_unique and resolve_human with a Breaking note.\",\" Share group membership validation between GroupTable::resolve and try_from_groups.\")\nrep('crates/callisto-graph/src/walk/tests.rs',\"a distinct-id count of 2 is required for ResolvedConfig.promoted_siblings' derivation to retain this name\",\"a distinct-id count of 2 is required to retain this name\")\nPYEOF\npython3 -c \"import json;json.load(open('docs/projects/V1-SYSTEM-HARDENING.json'))\" && echo ok; /usr/bin/git rm -q crates/callisto-graph/tests/cross_ecosystem_diagnostic_test.rs 2>&1 | tail -1; rg -n 'cross_ecosystem_diagnostic' . --glob '!target' | head","description":"Update docs and plan, remove vacuous diagnostic test file"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
