{"parentUuid":"235ac724-23d9-4de5-a366-582cff9d73b4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgG1dWDKECAtwriecJVrj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Ae2LGfoLaWcDSWT3vGRt1n","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sed -n 191p docs/specs/cli.json | cut -c1-700; sed -n 12,22p docs/specs/matrix.json | cut -c1-300; rg -n 'E317' docs/errors.md | cut -c1-300; rg -n 'E103' docs/errors.md | cut -c1-250","description":"Read doc lines about add --package and E103"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":327,"cache_read_input_tokens":651469,"output_tokens":378,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":194},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":327,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":378,"cache_read_input_tokens":651469,"cache_creation_input_tokens":327,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":327},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01Ae2LGfoLaWcDSWT3vGRt1n":{"command":"sed -n 191p docs/specs/cli.json | cut -c1-700; sed -n 12,22p docs/specs/matrix.json | cut -c1-300; rg -n 'E317' docs/errors.md | cut -c1-300; rg -n 'E103' docs/errors.md | cut -c1-250","description":"Read doc lines about add --package and E103"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"d4fba5dd-aea2-4755-b544-931012bc0bce","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgG1dVi42No6ymM85V91p","requestRef":"3cf75af0-b4f8-435d-89c4-9d1815d30ab2","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"9fa63d24-d149-40d0-b1e8-5d860080ae73","timestamp":"2026-10-21T20:27:05.823Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/t06-cli-args","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"worktree-t06-cli-args","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
{"parentUuid":"9fa63d24-d149-40d0-b1e8-5d860080ae73","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"f73ac011-449f-49f1-86f1-9e3c96614956","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ae2LGfoLaWcDSWT3vGRt1n","type":"tool_result","content":"      \"criterion\": \"`callisto add --package <name>:<severity> --summary <text>` (--package repeatable, bare or qualified names such as `cargo/app`, severity none, patch, minor or major) writes `.changeset/<adjective>-<noun>-<verb>.md`, choosing a name no file in `.changeset` already has and never replacing one, even if another `callisto add` created it a moment earlier, with front matter mapping each package to its severity and the trimmed summary as body, prints `Added changeset: <path>`, and never prompts.\"\n    {\n      \"name\": \"callisto matrix\",\n      \"signature\": \"callisto [--format text|json] matrix [--package <name>]\",\n      \"description\": \"Prints a MatrixReport with schemaVersion, platformTargets and runtimeVersions keyed by package id, plus diagnostics when any exist. Hidden from --help.\",\n      \"error_conditions\": [\n        \"E102: --package names no registered package.\",\n        \"E103: bare --package name matches packages in more than one ecosystem.\",\n        \"E118: one package declares both napi.targets and [tool.maturin].targets.\",\n        \"E203: a package with napi or maturin targets is also a cargo [[release.artifact]] package.\",\n        \"E204: a napi package's addon crate does not resolve to exactly one workspace crate.\",\n        \"Malformed package.json or pyproject.toml, or a target or runtime field of the wrong type.\"\n313:| E317 | A package named in `callisto.toml` has no ecosystem (`foo`) | Write `ecosystem/name` (`cargo/foo`, `npm/foo`, `pypi/foo`); `callisto.toml` accepts no other form. Changeset entries keep native names. |\n173:| E103 | A bare name matches more than one package; the message lists their qualified ids | Write the qualified id instead of `{name}`, e.g. in a changeset `cargo/{name}: minor`. |","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d3d51ca9-113f-44e6-9c0a-bc73cffdda54","timestamp":"2026-10-21T20:27:06.201Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"      \"criterion\": \"`callisto add --package <name>:<severity> --summary <text>` (--package repeatable, bare or qualified names such as `cargo/app`, severity none, patch, minor or major) writes `.changeset/<adjective>-<noun>-<verb>.md`, choosing a name no file in `.changeset` already has and never replacing one, even if another `callisto add` created it a moment earlier, with front matter mapping each package to its severity and the trimmed summary as body, prints `Added changeset: <path>`, and never prompts.\"\n    {\n      \"name\": \"callisto matrix\",\n      \"signature\": \"callisto [--format text|json] matrix [--package <name>]\",\n      \"description\": \"Prints a MatrixReport with schemaVersion, platformTargets and runtimeVersions keyed by package id, plus diagnostics when any exist. Hidden from --help.\",\n      \"error_conditions\": [\n        \"E102: --package names no registered package.\",\n        \"E103: bare --package name matches packages in more than one ecosystem.\",\n        \"E118: one package declares both napi.targets and [tool.maturin].targets.\",\n        \"E203: a package with napi or maturin targets is also a cargo [[release.artifact]] package.\",\n        \"E204: a napi package's addon crate does not resolve to exactly one workspace crate.\",\n        \"Malformed package.json or pyproject.toml, or a target or runtime field of the wrong type.\"\n313:| E317 | A package named in `callisto.toml` has no ecosystem (`foo`) | Write `ecosystem/name` (`cargo/foo`, `npm/foo`, `pypi/foo`); `callisto.toml` accepts no other form. Changeset entries keep native names. |\n173:| E103 | A bare name matches more than one package; the message lists their qualified ids | Write the qualified id instead of `{name}`, e.g. in a changeset `cargo/{name}: minor`. |","stderr":"","interr