{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","hash":"6ad9f8d153c33f6b2ab609dc39986e7fee1d6018a816f2758b58328e6dc9a900","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PM7jb5xcaC65QZcyjadvJU","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/15c732d1/tmp/docs_args.py","content":"def rep(path, old, new):\n    s = open(path).read()\n    assert old in s, (path, old[:60])\n    open(path, 'w').write(s.replace(old, new, 1))\n\n\nrep('docs/specs/cli.json',\n    '(--package repeatable, bare or qualified names such as `cargo/app`, severity none, patch, minor or major)',\n    '(--package repeatable, each name ecosystem-qualified such as `cargo/app`; a name without its ecosystem is E317; severity none, patch, minor or major)')\nrep('docs/specs/matrix.json',\n    '\"E103: bare --package name matches packages in more than one ecosystem.\",',\n    '\"E317: --package names a package without its ecosystem.\",')\nrep('docs/errors.md',\n    '| E317 | A package named in `callisto.toml` has no ecosystem (`foo`) | Write `ecosystem/name` (`cargo/foo`, `npm/foo`, `pypi/foo`); `callisto.toml` accepts no other form. Changeset entries keep native names. |',\n    '| E317 | A package named in `callisto.toml`, or in `add --package` or `matrix --package`, has no ecosystem (`foo`) | Write `ecosystem/name` (`cargo/foo`, `npm/foo`, `pypi/foo`); those places accept no other form. Changeset entries keep native names. |')\nrep('AGENTS.md', '`callisto add --package callisto-cli:<bump> --summary \"...\"`', '`callisto add --package cargo/callisto-cli:<bump> --summary \"...\"`')\nrep('.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.md', '`callisto add --package my-crate:minor`', '`callisto add --package cargo/my-crate:minor`')\nprint('ok')\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0198NRfYA1FXHqP63csMxxHx","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/t06-cli-args/.changeset/package-arguments-require-ecosystem.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\n`callisto add --package` and `callisto matrix --package` now require the ecosystem, such as `cargo/foo:minor` and `npm/foo`. A bare name is rejected with E317 showing the form to write, so a name can no longer become ambiguous when a package in another ecosystem later takes it. `release --package` already required it.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
