{"parentUuid":"a8fc9fe9-1e36-400b-957e-1848095df7bb","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PreToolUse:Bash","toolUseID":"toolu_01Y4mcNmyzFTzSAxVdzst8bq","hookEvent":"PreToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"PreToolUse\",\"permissionDecisionReason\":\"RTK auto-rewrite\",\"updatedInput\":{\"command\":\"rtk read crates/callisto-model/README.md crates/callisto-graph/README.md crates/callisto-manifests/README.md; rtk rg -n 'description' crates/*/Cargo.toml\",\"description\":\"Read library crate READMEs and descriptions\"}}}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"rtk hook claude","durationMs":14},"type":"attachment","uuid":"ceaea865-b1f1-4b2e-bdd1-85e3ed7198cd","timestamp":"2026-10-21T20:33:02.175Z","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/docs-v1-claims","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"worktree-docs-v1-claims","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
{"parentUuid":"a8fc9fe9-1e36-400b-957e-1848095df7bb","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ac3a43c9-5f04-4f6e-bd51-a254b59d0b5a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y4mcNmyzFTzSAxVdzst8bq","type":"tool_result","content":"# callisto-model\n\nShared types and traits for callisto: package identity, versions, manifests, dependency specs, and the versioned JSON report contract. Also holds `atomic_write`, the `ApplyPermit` capability token, the changeset and `pre.json` formats (`format`, formerly `callisto-format`) and Git access through the git CLI (`vcs`, formerly `callisto-vcs`).\n\nLicense: MIT. See [ARCHITECTURE.md](../../ARCHITECTURE.md) for the full crate map and [the root README](../../README.md) for the CLI.\n# callisto-graph\n\nDependency graph, cascade engine, changeset/commit aggregation, config resolution, and release execution for callisto. Includes Conventional Commit inference (`conventional`, formerly `callisto-conventional`) and changelog rendering (`changelog`, formerly `callisto-changelog`). The workspace's engine crate — most CLI commands are thin wrappers over this crate.\n\nLicense: FSL-1.1-MIT. See [ARCHITECTURE.md](../../ARCHITECTURE.md) for the full crate map and [the root README](../../README.md) for the CLI.\n# callisto-manifests\n\nPer-ecosystem manifest read/write for callisto: the `Manifest` trait plus format-preserving Cargo, npm, and PyPI editors (`toml_edit`, fingerprinted `serde_json`).\n\nLicense: FSL-1.1-MIT. See [ARCHITECTURE.md](../../ARCHITECTURE.md) for the full crate map and [the root README](../../README.md) for the CLI.\ncrates/callisto-model/Cargo.toml:6:description = \"Callisto Release Engine — Core domain types, changeset and pre.json formats, and Git access.\"\ncrates/callisto-manifests/Cargo.toml:6:description = \"Callisto Release Engine — CST-preserving manifest editors for Cargo.toml, package.json, and pyproject.toml.\"\ncrates/callisto-graph/Cargo.toml:6:description = \"Callisto Release Engine — Dependency graph, cascade, version planning, changelogs and release execution.\"\ncrates/callisto-fixtures/Cargo.toml:6:description = \"Callisto Release Engine — Dev-only byte-compat test corpus and shared test doubles.\"\ncrates/callisto-cli/Cargo.toml:6:description = \"Callisto Release Engine — Polyglot monorepo versioning and release management CLI.\"","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"59dbc713-16d8-46f5-b3e4-33b7f661d40d","timestamp":"2026-10-21T20:33:04.773Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"# callisto-model\n\nShared types and traits for callisto: package identity, versions, manifests, dependency specs, and the versioned JSON report contract. Also holds `atomic_write`, the `ApplyPermit` capability token, the changeset and `pre.json` formats (`format`, formerly `callisto-format`) and Git access through the git CLI (`vcs`, formerly `callisto-vcs`).\n\nLicense: MIT. See [ARCHITECTURE.md](../../ARCHITECTURE.md) for the full crate map and [the root README](../../README.md) for the CLI.\n# callisto-graph\n\nDependency graph, cascade engine, changeset/commit aggregation, config resolution, and release execution for callisto. Includes Conventional Commit inference (`conventional`, formerly `callisto-conventional`) and changelog rendering (`changelog`, formerly `callisto-changelog`). The workspace's engine crate — most CLI commands are thin wrappers over this crate.\n\nLicense: FSL-1.1-MIT. See [ARCHITECTURE.md](../../ARCHITECTURE.md) for the full crate map and [the root README](../../README.md) for the CLI.\n# callisto-manifests\n\nPer-ecosystem manifest read/write for callisto: the `Manifest` trait plus format-preserving Cargo, npm, and PyPI editors (`toml_edit`, fingerprinted `serde_json`).\n\nLicense: FSL-1.1-MIT. See [ARCHITECTURE.md](../../ARCHITECTURE.md) for the full crate map and [the root README](../../README.md) for the CLI.\ncrates/callisto-model/Cargo.toml:6:description = \"Callisto Release Engine — Core domain types, changeset and pre.json formats, and Git access.\"\ncrates/callisto-manifests/Cargo.toml:6:description = \"Callisto Release Engine — CST-preserving manifest editors for Cargo.toml, package.json, and pyproject.toml.\"\ncrates/callisto-graph/Cargo.toml:6:description = \"Callisto Release Engine — Dependency graph, cascade, version planning, changelogs and release execution.\"\ncrates/callisto-fixtures/Cargo.toml:6:description = \"Callisto Release Engine — Dev-only byte-compat test corpus and shared test doubles.\"\ncrates/callisto-cli/Cargo.toml:6:description = \"Callisto Release Engine — Polyglot monorepo versioning and release management CLI.\"","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"classifierBoundary":true,"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"bff3518c-8ff5-4cc3-8ac8-05a66905dc87","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/docs-v1-claims","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/docs-v1-claims","branch":"worktree-docs-v1-claims","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/docs-v1-claims","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a8fc9fe9-1e36-400b-957e-1848095df7bb","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/docs-v1-claims","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"worktree-docs-v1-claims","slug